 * Hold-to-talk semantics (press=record, release=ASR), as specified in
 * UI方案.md §2.5 ("PTT=按下录音→松手触发 ASR；可挂 S1").  Button index,
 * long-press threshold, and devpath are Kconfig-tunable.
