2. Key Technical Concepts:
   - BK7258 dual-core (CP=CPU0 / AP=CPU1), OpenVela/NuttX; UI/LVGL now runs on AP; `ai_agent` from AP NSH.
   - Serial `/dev/ttyUSB0` @115200; NSH prompt `nsh-ap>`, app prompt `vela>`.
