   - `agent_loop_start()` was previously gated on network (`network_wait_connected(30000)` / `net_state_change_cb`), so offline `ask` messages were silently swallowed (no loop thread).
   - Agent loop flow: pop inbound → memory check → slash commands → injection check → NL fast path → LLM (pet THINKING) → vision/ReAct → `dispatch_response` → pet IDLE.
   - `dispatch_response()` pushes outbound on the original channel; `cli` branch prints `[Agent]:` and mirrors to LVGL; `voice` branch calls `voice_channel_speak()` and sets pet ERROR (5) on failure; `lvgl_ui` branch calls `lvgl_ui_channel_send()`.
   - AP `lvgl_ui_channel_send()` (ui_rpmsg_client.c) **synchronously calls `voice_channel_speak()` first**, then sends the RPMsg bubble to CP; `lvgl_ui_channel_send_user()` sends a right-aligned user bubble with **no TTS**; `lvgl_ui_channel_send_ex(text, bar_color)` sends a colored-bar card (bar_color 0 = auto-classify).
