82	 * escalates to "Panic by remote core: ap" and resets AP.
83	 *
84	 * Hold this lock around any LVGL entry point called from a non-LVGL
85	 * thread, and around lv_timer_handler() itself.
86	 *
87	 * Recursion is required: LVGL-thread callbacks (pet_idle_timer_cb,
88	 * standby_timer_cb) themselves queue async calls.  CONFIG_PTHREAD_MUTEX_TYPES
